  "keyFeatures": [
    "25+ built-in chart types including bar, line, pie, scatter, map, sankey, treemap, sunburst, word cloud, and more",
    "Cross-platform support for browser, Node.js, WeChat Mini Program, Lark Mini App, Taro, and Harmony",
    "Rich animation system with entrance, exit, and update animations plus morph transitions",
    "Comprehensive interaction model: hover, select, highlight, brush, data zoom, and scroll bar",
    "Declarative JSON spec API for easy configuration and serialization",
    "Theming system with built-in light/dark themes and full customization via token-based design",
    "React, OpenInula, and Taro component wrappers for framework integration",
    "3D chart variants: bar-3d, pie-3d, funnel-3d, histogram-3d, word-cloud-3d",
    "Extension charts: ranking bar, candlestick, storyline, pictogram, image cloud, and more",
    "Tree-shakable architecture with fine-grained register functions for minimal bundle size"
  ],
